    "detailed_description": "<strong>Demolish &amp; Build 3</strong> will include brand new demolition and driving physics.<br>This tech demo will allow you to try them out for free before the final release!<br><br><strong>Demolish &amp; Build 3: Prologue will include the first few missions of the full game and features</strong><br><br>\ud83d\udea7 Large excavator.<br>\ud83d\udea7 Skid steer.<br>\ud83d\udea7 Attachments<br>\ud83d\udea7 Physics-based track mechanics,<br>\ud83d\udea7 Vehicle controls based on real machines.<br>\ud83d\udea7 Full controller support,<br>\ud83d\udea7 Fully destructible objects and structures<br>\ud83d\udea7 Third-person and first-person camera modes,<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/3fff02645d2a86f757e0e12fd1a6547b.poster.avif?t=1726209983\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/3fff02645d2a86f757e0e12fd1a6547b.webm?t=1726209983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/3fff02645d2a86f757e0e12fd1a6547b.mp4?t=1726209983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What after the prologue? Max torque forward towards the main game release where we will bring even more...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/ad221f10ceb156eadff1ec0dccf3279e.poster.avif?t=1726209983\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/ad221f10ceb156eadff1ec0dccf3279e.webm?t=1726209983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/ad221f10ceb156eadff1ec0dccf3279e.mp4?t=1726209983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>and <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/3d85232b705d5cfd6cc41e4a02e46b91.poster.avif?t=1726209983\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/3d85232b705d5cfd6cc41e4a02e46b91.webm?t=1726209983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803230/extras/3d85232b705d5cfd6cc41e4a02e46b91.mp4?t=1726209983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Stay tuned for upcoming news and rumors from the construction site by adding our game to your Wishlist. Thanks in advance!",
